ready: 1
kind: entity_group
id: consolidation.data
module: consolidation
title: Consolidation data
summary: Suggestions waiting for review, processing marks, and the record of every maintenance run.
entities:
  - consolidation.data.suggestion
  - consolidation.data.transition-mark
  - consolidation.data.run
rationale: >-
  Marks are kept per transition, not as one processed flag per source, so promoting an episode
  to a belief never hides it from the transitions that turn episodes into goals, relationships,
  drives, guardrails, or playbooks.


  Daily model usage is the sum of run rows, so the budget needs no separate counter that could
  drift from the runs that actually spent the tokens.
